<title>USA: Hydron board oks buyback up to one mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Hydron board oks buyback up to one mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hydron Technologies Inc said Monday its board authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares in the open market.</p>
<p>The company said its plan call for the purchases to be made from time to time throughout the period expiring on March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>The company said the plan is part of a &quot;long term policy&quot; for reducing the total number of shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Hydron Technologies develops personal care products, including skin care, hair care, bath and body products.</p>
</text>
